{"src":"en","tgt":"de","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":173600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"de","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"route","t":2903.069833,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":9401.948478,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in Danger due to the threat of desert sands."},{"kind":"text","t":9883.093876,"text":"1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensande in die Liste der gefährdeten Welterbestätten aufgenommen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":10556.298374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":10558.46819,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10559.747065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10560.554900000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10562.275029,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10562.709193,"samples":13931,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"route","t":13003.108604000001,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":18301.523822,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":18799.190013,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film National Treasure gesehen haben, glauben Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte geschrieben stand. "},{"kind":"audio","t":19511.461848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19512.752269999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19514.465678999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19516.239478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19518.134459999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19519.334927,"samples":24241,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"route","t":19701.440327,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":25474.053796999997,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for a wide variety of reasons that range from neglect to abuse."},{"kind":"text","t":25894.952793999997,"text":"Kinder kommen aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien, die von Vernachlässigung bis hin zu Missbrauch reichen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":26484.26929,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26485.641104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26487.405289,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26489.202664999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26489.992682999997,"samples":16885,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"route","t":26501.944069999998,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":28659.59331,"text":"and even to extortion."},{"kind":"text","t":28825.543956999998,"text":"und sogar bis hin zu Erpressung. "},{"kind":"audio","t":29019.742867999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29020.025433,"samples":4569,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"route","t":29701.704015,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":38818.072744000005,"text":"Chocamo Valley, Chile's premier climbing destination, known as the Yosemite of South America, with a variety of granite big walls and crags."},{"kind":"text","t":39475.525386,"text":"Das Chocamo-Tal, Chiles bedeutendstes Klettergebiet, bekannt als das Yosemite Südamerikas, mit einer Vielzahl an Granit-Big-Walls und Felsklettern. "},{"kind":"audio","t":40261.501957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40262.748132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40264.502212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40266.396153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40268.257303000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40269.905034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40270.476744,"samples":13764,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"route","t":40270.559228000006,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"text","t":45998.278692,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen wissenschaftlichen Fragen, einschließlich der Physiologie, wurden akzeptiert. "},{"kind":"audio","t":46568.994063000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46570.236313,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46571.966467000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46573.724072000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46574.860032000004,"samples":22458,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":49888.893808,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology. If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":50255.589609,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie wachsam. Steile Steigungen, schmale Gassen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":50878.489338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":50880.484090000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50881.822274000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50881.98558,"samples":4235,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"audio","t":50883.768112000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50885.564756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50886.337449,"samples":17219,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"route","t":51801.343901,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"route","t":53201.136150000006,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":62307.095062,"text":"The presence of the true invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109, is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"text","t":63005.712086,"text":"Die Präsenz des wahren unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109, ist ebenfalls eine einzigartige Komponente eines virtuellen Teams. "},{"kind":"audio","t":64091.413094999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64092.728996000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64094.45433200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64096.092848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64097.957855,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64099.870584000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64101.63764300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64103.485965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64103.706257,"samples":6742,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"route","t":64103.82924200001,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":67010.43543700001,"text":"After the accident occurred, Gibson was transported to a hospital but died shortly after."},{"kind":"text","t":67414.56794000001,"text":"Nachdem der Unfall passiert war, wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus transportiert, verstarb jedoch kurz darauf. "},{"kind":"audio","t":67984.13994000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67986.11090700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67987.401809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":67989.167046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67989.417934,"samples":9083,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"route","t":68401.090975,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"text","t":74859.43824,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren enthalten Mandeln, Haselnüsse und andere Schalenfrüchte. "},{"kind":"audio","t":75290.503337,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75291.826608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75293.463562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75293.783824,"samples":10643,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"input","t":76217.036076,"text":"Many German baked goods are feature almonds, hazelnuts, and other tree nuts. Popular cakes often pair particularly well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"text","t":76509.640878,"text":"Beliebte Kuchen passen oft besonders gut zu einer Tasse starkem Kaffee. "},{"kind":"audio","t":76894.625313,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76895.939331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76897.396113,"samples":26972,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"route","t":77702.463136,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":82987.305957,"text":"Needless to say, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"text","t":83518.04040700001,"text":"Es versteht sich von selbst, dass es einfacher für Sie sein wird, Portugiesisch zu lernen, wenn Sie eine romanische Sprache beherrschen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":84214.61056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":84215.858358,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84217.545517,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84219.27766400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84220.592263,"samples":26359,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"route","t":85501.647581,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":89880.206538,"text":"The Pyramid Sound and Light Show is one of the most interesting things in the area for kids."},{"kind":"text","t":90308.570009,"text":"Die Pyramiden-Ton- und Lichtshow ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen der Gegend für Kinder. "},{"kind":"audio","t":90814.505766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90816.472576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90817.904832,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90819.207352,"samples":25690,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"route","t":91201.76734800001,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":95378.019071,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points."},{"kind":"text","t":95685.91527700001,"text":"Der Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten. "},{"kind":"audio","t":96212.63962100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96214.050335,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96215.84052900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96217.56908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":96217.694138,"samples":167,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":96401.648662,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":98086.547668,"text":"and the interactions they make with one another."},{"kind":"text","t":98295.137087,"text":"und die Interaktionen, die sie miteinander eingehen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":98599.072883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98600.384567,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98600.603987,"samples":7746,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"route","t":99100.997053,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":107088.56661000001,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's competitor"},{"kind":"text","t":107543.436483,"text":"Australiens Mitchell Gowrie belegte im Super-G der Männer den 11. Platz, der Konkurrent von Chet "},{"kind":"audio","t":108016.341298,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108017.931932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108019.349025,"samples":27808,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":108021.13168800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108021.90445100001,"samples":15993,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"route","t":108021.988287,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":113056.443663,"text":"Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":113489.527338,"text":"Ulrich Joklin belegte im Super-G der Männer in der Kategorie sitzend den 16. Platz. "},{"kind":"audio","t":113965.383114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113966.780117,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113968.557983,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":113968.906147,"samples":10365,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":240},{"kind":"audio","t":113969.668835,"samples":16718,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":610},{"kind":"route","t":113969.75915,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":119175.0533,"text":"As reference, independent studies suggest that Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion unknowingly brought"},{"kind":"text","t":119569.964405,"text":"Unabhängigen Studien zufolge brachte ein nepalesisches UN-Friedenseinsatzbattalion unwissentlich "},{"kind":"audio","t":120085.556525,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120086.974359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120088.791514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120090.067063,"samples":24297,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"route","t":120401.346191,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":125975.399196,"text":"Soon after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain initiated a naval blockade of Germany."},{"kind":"text","t":126369.029483,"text":"Kurz nach Ausbruch der Feindseligkeiten leitete Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland ein. "},{"kind":"audio","t":126949.99453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126951.610642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126953.414166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126955.346595,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126955.572745,"samples":8247,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"route","t":128901.154792,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"text","t":134259.54973,"text":"Es griff zudem alles an, was ins Wasser gelangte. "},{"kind":"audio","t":134538.877691,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134540.22223400002,"samples":31876,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"input","t":134710.148805,"text":"It also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur such as T-Rex would be no match for it."},{"kind":"text","t":135038.468088,"text":"Selbst ein riesiger Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex wäre ihm nicht gewachsen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":135471.546295,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135473.083017,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135474.901284,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135475.013172,"samples":3956,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"route","t":137502.011161,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":147224.852816,"text":"The use of video recording has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of micro-expressions, facial movements, which last a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"text","t":147809.919867,"text":"Der Einsatz von Videoaufzeichnungen hat zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen bei der Interpretation von Mikroexpressionen geführt – Gesichtsbewegungen, die nur wenige Millisekunden dauern. "},{"kind":"audio","t":148692.317733,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148693.58386800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148695.35943,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148697.121663,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148699.057256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148700.848391,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148702.044792,"samples":23238,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"route","t":149301.617464,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":154476.417039,"text":"The announcement was made after Trump had a phone conversation with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":154891.087812,"text":"Die Bekanntgabe erfolgte, nachdem Trump ein Telefonat mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan geführt hatte. "},{"kind":"audio","t":155553.830816,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155554.829178,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155556.654976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155558.401304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155559.670605,"samples":24687,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"route","t":155701.36801,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":160971.977571,"text":"These are sometimes crowded family beaches with a good range of shops aligning the shore."},{"kind":"text","t":161353.193233,"text":"Dies sind manchmal überfüllte Familienstrände mit einer guten Auswahl an Geschäften entlang der Küste. "},{"kind":"audio","t":161880.925895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":161882.464831,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":161884.145471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":161885.789865,"samples":30705,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"route","t":161900.640445,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"text","t":173164.470712,"text":"Ich will nur auf Nummer sicher gehen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":173355.155374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173355.537208,"samples":9306,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":173602.744878,"text":"Just want to get safe. Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or associated with France and known as luxury beach resorts."},{"kind":"text","t":174025.61483,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder mit Frankreich verbunden und als luxuriöse Strandresorts bekannt. "},{"kind":"audio","t":174747.708557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174749.101474,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174750.928664,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174752.751257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174754.56886200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174755.193773,"samples":13931,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"route","t":174755.268736,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"close","t":184802.69515400002,"code":1005}]}